      "description": "Signature unit of change: header state, word diff, why line, Apply/Dismiss.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-head\"><span>Summary</span><em>Not applied</em></div><div class=\"ds-card-body\">Built <del>internal tools</del> <ins>event-driven data pipelines</ins> serving 2M users<div class=\"ds-why\">Matches the JD's streaming focus.</div></div><div class=\"ds-card-foot\"><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-primary\">Apply</button><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-ghost\">Dismiss</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;font:500 12.75px/1.5 var(--font);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus)}.ds-btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-btn-primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-fg)}.ds-btn-ghost{background:transparent;border-color:transparent;color:var(--text-2)}.ds-card{font:400 13.5px/1.5 var(--font);color:var(--text);background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-1);overflow:hidden;max-width:360px}.ds-card-head{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:9px 12px;background:var(--surface-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12.75px;font-weight:600}.ds-card-head span{flex:1}.ds-card-head em{font-style:normal;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-3)}.ds-card-body{padding:10px 12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.6}.ds-card-body del{background:var(--del-bg);color:var(--del-text);border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px}.ds-card-body ins{background:var(--add-bg);color:var(--add-text);text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px}.ds-why{margin-top:8px;font-size:12.75px;color:var(--text-3)}.ds-card-foot{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:10px 12px}"
